# SDK & Other-Product Boundaries

When these paths are open, assume **read-mostly** unless the user explicitly asks to change them.

## `include_lib/`

SDK public headers and prebuilt libs (`include_lib/liba/sh55/voice_toy/*.a`). Prefer adapting app code to existing APIs over modifying SDK headers.

## `app/bsp/common/`

Shared BSP (decoder, USB, FS, key, msg). Do not rewrite these stacks to implement product features — extend `app/src/` instead.

## Non-AD15 trees

- `app/src/mcu/`, `app/src/mbox_mg/`
- CPU dirs other than `sh55` (`sh54`, `sh57`, `ch58`)
- Matching Makefiles / `.cbp` for AD14/AD17/AD18/AC104

Default product work stays on **AD15N + sh55 + voice_toy**. Only port or edit other trees when the user names that target.
